== Trivia ==
* Trying to get too close to any of the [[Auction Agent]]s or the '''Auction Master''' will get the player pushed away. Doing this multiple times will teleport the [[player]] outside the {{zone|Auction House}}.
* {{zone|Dragontail Auction House}} and {{zone|Scarleton Auction House}} each feature an NPC with the Auction Master "title", {{NPCSprite|Bromm}} and {{NPCSprite|Elmar}} respectively.

